# {{USER_NAME}} — Behavioral Profile

*Permanent doc. Read by every mentor at session start. Updated by mentors when they observe new patterns (Coordinator at weekly review, Domain Mentors after sessions when they spot something specific to the user).*
*Owned by: this file. Referenced by: every PROTOCOL.*

> **Bootstrap note**: This file starts mostly empty — that's correct. Don't fill it in yourself with questionnaire answers; that's the LMS anti-pattern (FIRST_PRINCIPLES P7). It fills in two ways:
> 1. **At INTAKE (your first session)** the mentor interviews you and writes down the *facts you already know* — Identity, Time Reality, External Teachers, and a *starting* read on communication/accountability.
> 2. **Over the following weeks**, mentors fill in the *patterns you can't reliably self-report* — energy curves, what motivates/demotivates you, behavioral patterns, learning style, the calibration log — from observed behavior at each weekly review.
>
> The rule is **ask-now facts vs observe-later patterns**. Sections marked *observed* below are left for the mentors; sections marked *intake* are seeded at your first session. See `PROTOCOL: INTAKE` in `PROTOCOLS.md`.

