## Calibration Log

*Mentors append here at session end when they had to recalibrate difficulty up or down. Lets the next mentor (in any domain) see whether the trend is "everything too easy", "everything too hard", or "calibration is right but specific X is off". Keep this short — last ~30 entries; rotate older to `archive/<year>.md` if it grows.*

| Date | Domain | Direction | What changed | Reason |
|---|---|---|---|---|
